# Generated documents — invoice and quotation PDFs.
# They are customer data, they are regenerated on demand from the invoice record,
# and `git add -A` was picking them up. Object storage is the real answer
# (BUILD-STATUS "not started" #3); until then, at least keep them out of git.
apps/api/storage/

# Minted session tokens from local API probing. These are real, working
# credentials — the admin one included — and they were sitting untracked and
# un-ignored, one `git add -A` away from being in the history for good.
apps/api/.tokens
apps/api/.admin.token
apps/*/.tokens
apps/*/*.token

# Scratch response dumps from curl-ing the API by hand.
apps/api/r.json
